{"id": "68347", "title": "玉石非玉", "author": "羲和清零", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 36, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/68/68347.htm", "intro": "【文案】\r\n古有言：“珉之雕雕，不若玉之章章。”\r\n意思是说，像玉一样的石头，再怎么精雕细琢，也不如玉好看啊。\r\n\r\n那么，是否有人能摒除玉石一切外在的光环与假象，识破顽石其内在，以水为爱呵护滋养？\r\n自认不完美的男孩们，也能在最好的年纪，遇到属于他们的爱情。\r\n\r\nI am not a prince，but live up to the best years.\r\n玉石非玉，亦不负年华。", "base": "files/article/html/68/68347", "chapters": [{"title": "第一章（修订）", "file": "10525662.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二章（修订）", "file": "10525663.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三章（修订）", "file": "10525664.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四章（修订）", "file": "10525665.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五章（修订）", "file": "10525666.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第六章（修订）", "file": "10525667.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第七章（修订）", "file": "10525668.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第八章（修订）", "file": "10525669.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第九章（修订）", "file": "10525670.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十章（修订）", "file": "10525671.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十一章（修订）", "file": "10525672.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十二章（修订）", "file": "10525673.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十三章（修订）", "file": "10525674.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十四章（修订）", "file": "10525675.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十五章（修订）", "file": "10525676.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十六章（修订）", "file": "10525677.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十七章（修订）", "file": "10525678.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十八章（修订）", "file": "10525679.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十九章（修订）", "file": "10525680.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十章（修订）", "file": "10525681.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-24", "file": "10525682.html", "available": false}, {"title": "25-28", "file": "10525683.html", "available": false}, {"title": "29-32", "file": "10525684.html", "available": false}, {"ti